"""
MCX V12 ENGINE — Full Implementation of Expert's MCX Architecture
=================================================================

Implements all 12 expert recommendations:
#7A  Multi-session scheduler (morning/evening/US-open)
#8   Strict FUTCOM-only contract resolver with CE/PE/expiry rejection
#9   Correct nested Dhan MCX_COMM LTP parsing
#10  Circuit breaker with exponential backoff on 429
#11  MCX-specific scoring: time-of-day RVOL, ATR-normalized extension tiers, no ORB exception
#12  Execution quality gate: quote staleness, spread, slippage, depth

ENGINEER CONTRACT:
- This is a SYNCHRONOUS engine (not async). V8.6 async was a skeleton.
- Uses existing NativeMCXData class for REST API calls.
- Imports V12 validation functions from V11_V12_HARDENED_COMBINED_PATCH.
- Does NOT replace mcx_v854_engine.py — NEW file the orchestrator switches to.
- MCX_LIVE defaults False (shadow). Only True enables broker interaction.
- Gateway=None for shadow mode.

Version: MCX_V12_ENGINE_2026_08_31
"""

